# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

Token Services are used for Proof of Identity in SteelShield. They authenticate game clients and issue SteelShield Tokens that are used to authorize game traffic.

A token service verifies game client JWTs using one of three authentication methods: per-platform verification keys, a JWKS endpoint, or an external identity provider (EOS).

For details check the <a href="https://docs.gamefabric.com/steelshield/token-service/">GameFabric documentation</a>.

